- If you give me the passport expiry date and the visa start date (or planned entry date), I’ll calculate whether your passport meets the typical 6‑month rule.
- I can also look up the specific country’s consulate/embassy visa requirements (if you tell me which country) and draft an email to them — but don’t include your SSN in that email.

If you want me to check now, please provide:
- The country (which consulate/visa),
- Your planned entry date or visa start date,
- Your passport expiry date.

I’ll calculate and tell you whether you likely need to renew.

